WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.100
Who's involved?

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.607
The authorizing official
decides attack disruption as a

3
00:00:04.607 --> 00:00:08.113
class on the response ladder,
and approves each exclusion.

4
00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:11.108
The security operations
lead owns both gates:

5
00:00:11.108 --> 00:00:14.813
the weekly hunt, and a quarterly
review of the exclusions.

6
00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:19.400
The platform owner sets the device group
levels with the security operations lead.

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.578
One note: the ladder's mapping
is the program's design,

8
00:00:22.578 --> 00:00:27.012
and the authorizing official's attack
disruption decision comes first.

9
00:00:27.012 --> 00:00:30.790
The kit checks the settings against
it; it doesn't make the decision.
